  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FF8C42>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> AbilityCasterBehaviour.TryCastAtUnit
    / TryCast / TryCastAtPoint; AbilitySystem.Trace (Explain); ModifierInstance.GetRemainingCharges
    / Stacks; AbilityTemplates.*.\n<color=#FF8C42>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b>
    Hub: library, formation ring archetype, Trace Enabled. Units: UnitTemplate assets
    with abilities and innate modifiers (shield passive, thorns). Buttons -> AbilitiesTriggersDemoGuide
    (persistent).\n<color=#FF8C42>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b> Strike: golem
    -20, hero -6 (thorns). Empower: three hits of 30. Mark: three hits +15. Dart:
    venom stacks tick 4 per stack. Formation: ring, pulses, slow. Smash x3: the shield
    appears below 40% HP.\n<color=#FF8C42>\xBB</color>  Assets: Scenes/Abilities/Assets/Triggers
    (abilities, modifiers, templates, library, ring prefab)\n<color=#FF8C42>\xBB</color> 
    Modifier reactions: Trigger, Max Triggers, Remove When Spent, Hits Only, Cooldown\n<color=#FF8C42>\xBB</color> 
    Why panel: AbilitySystem.Trace.Explain(latest reaction)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
